 c\, a silent auction\, a cash prize drawing and a Kids Corner with face pa
 inting and balloons. Proceeds go to the lodge's charitable donations and s
 cholarships in the Pensacola area. Confirm the dates and hours with the lo
 dge before you go.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com
