 ay of 18th century demonstrations. Historical groups from across the regio
 n show musket firing\, military drills and colonial skills\, and explain h
 ow people handled laundry\, money and hygiene. The festival also looks at 
 the foods and social life of European and Indigenous colonial communities.
 \n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-fort-co
